[b]Enable manually after installation: Settings → Input → Touchscreen mode.[/b]
Touchscreen mode is off by default. Subscribe, restart the game, then turn it on using the game's settings.

Play Slay the Spire 2 with touchscreen controls. Designed for Steam Deck, tablets, and touchscreen PCs, whether you play directly on the device or connect to your PC through remote desktop or game streaming.

[b]Combat[/b]
Drag a card onto its target to play it, or tap the card first and then tap its target. Cards that don't need a target can be dragged into the play area. In co-op, you can also target teammates through the list on the left.

[b]Fewer accidental taps[/b]
Take a look before you commit: card rewards, shop purchases, and co-op treasure relics ask you to confirm your choice. Drag-to-scroll and long-press card previews make browsing easier, while relics, enemy intents, powers, and teammate details remain available to inspect.

[b]Enable touchscreen mode[/b]
Subscribe to this mod and restart the game. Open Settings → Input and turn on Touchscreen mode. Hold to inspect and Touch feedback can be turned on or off separately.

No other mods are required.

You can use a controller as usual. To return to the game's original mouse controls, turn off Touchscreen mode.

Game version: v0.111.0.

[b]Testing and feedback[/b]
Controls have been tested on Windows with no issues found. I don't have a Steam Deck, so Deck support has only had simulated testing so far. If you play on a Deck, I'd love to hear how it works for you and about any problems you encounter.

[b]Source code and feedback[/b]
[url=https://github.com/zerolfx/Touch-STS2]GitHub: Touch-STS2[/url]
[url=https://github.com/zerolfx/Touch-STS2/issues]Report a bug or suggest an improvement[/url]
[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/changelog/3804990566]Change notes[/url]

[b]安装后需手动开启：设置 → 操作设置 → 触屏模式。[/b]
触屏模式默认关闭。订阅并重启游戏后，请在游戏设置中开启。

为《杀戮尖塔 2》加入触屏支持。适合使用 Steam Deck、平板或触屏电脑的玩家，无论是直接在设备上运行游戏，还是通过远程桌面或游戏串流连接电脑游玩。

平板玩家推荐搭配 UU 远程：在电脑上安装本模组并运行游戏，再用平板连接电脑，就可以用触屏操作游玩。

[b]战斗操作[/b]
将卡牌拖到目标身上即可出牌，也可以先点选卡牌，再点击目标。不需要指定目标的卡牌，拖到出牌区域即可打出。联机时，也可以通过左侧队友列表选择队友作为目标。

[b]减少误触[/b]
卡牌奖励、商店购买和联机宝箱的遗物选择都需要再次确认，可以先看清楚，再作决定。拖动滚动和长按预览让浏览卡牌更方便，遗物、敌人意图、状态和队友信息也都可以照常查看。

[b]开启触屏模式[/b]
订阅本模组并重启游戏后，打开“设置 → 操作设置”，开启“触屏模式”。“长按查看”和“触点反馈”可以分别开关。

本模组不需要其他前置模组。

手柄可以照常使用。如果想恢复游戏原来的鼠标操作方式，关闭“触屏模式”即可。

游戏版本：v0.111.0。

[b]测试与反馈[/b]
已在 Windows 上测试，目前未发现操作问题。由于没有 Steam Deck 实机，Deck 支持目前只做了模拟测试。欢迎 Deck 玩家反馈使用体验和遇到的问题。

